{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56089","headline":"通玄赞八首 四 · 杜光庭","name":"通玄赞八首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"善哉元始尊，慈悲度一切。\n德出虚空表，功满尘沙界。\n广说大乘经，发生无上慧。\n轮回周亿劫，教化通三世。\n精贯有形中，妙穷无色际。\n迹遍方方域，道应天天帝。\n权实度天人，机缘随巨细。\n神用难可穷，方圆无不制。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56089.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56089","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}